    "notes": {
        "11111111-e2e0-4000-8000-000000000003": {
            "content": "## ⚠️ Manual E2E — requires a storefront action\n\n`checkouts/update` cannot be provoked through the Admin API (checkout POST returns 406, storefront tokens are denied) — only a real storefront checkout session fires it.\n\n### How to test\n1. Start this flow (the webhook is registered on start).\n2. Open the online store in an **incognito window** (https://<store>.myshopify.com; the dev-store password is in Online Store → Preferences). A fresh window forces a NEW checkout session — a reused window resumes the previous checkout instead.\n3. Add a product to the cart and click through to the checkout page — creating the checkout session fires **checkouts/create**;\n4. then enter the **email address and shipping address** and continue to the payment step — each contact/address change fires **checkouts/update**.\n\nThe Assert then verifies the emitted checkout (token + topic) and ProcessE2EResults records the result. AfterAll timeout is 600 s — finish the storefront steps within 10 minutes of starting the flow.",
            "height": 400,
            "width": 400,
            "x": 64,
            "y": -128
        }
    }
